- [braces-position |rules/braces-position] `singleLineAnonymousFunctions: allowed, emptyBodies: ownLine, classes: nextLine, anonymousClasses: sameLine, anonymousFunctions: sameLine, controlStructures: sameLine, emptyAnonymousClasses: sameLine`
