- `ordered-imports` `order: alphabetical, caseSensitive: false`
- `ordered-members` `order: [use_trait]`
- `parentheses-spacing`
- `phpdoc-canonical-types` `arrayNotation: keep`
- `phpdoc-trim`
- `reference-spacing`
- `semicolon-spacing` `after: single`
- `short-array-syntax`
- `single-member-per-declaration` `members: [property, trait]`
- `single-member-per-line`
