`dresscode/nette-style`
=======================

Rozvržení kódu podle Nette Coding Standardu: PER s tabulátory a odchylkami, které Nette dělá; o tom, která pravidla projekt zapíná, neříká nic, odsazení tabulátorem, konec řádku podle souboru. Pravidel celkem: 19.

- `array-spacing`
- [blank-lines |rules/blank-lines] `beforeNamespace: 1, afterOpeningTag: keep, afterNamespace: 1, afterImports: 1, betweenImportGroups: 0, beforeDeclaration: 2, betweenFunctions: 2, betweenFunctionsInInterface: 1, betweenMembers: [0, 1], beforeDocumentedMember: 1, afterPhpDoc: 0, afterBlockBrace: 0`
- [braces-position |rules/braces-position] `multiLineParameters: nextLineAfterReturnType, emptyBodies: ownLine, singleLineAnonymousFunctions: allowed`
- `class-definition-spacing` `beforeParenthesis: single`
- `comma-spacing` `alignment: tabs`
- `comment-spacing`
- `double-colon-spacing`
- `indentation` `chain: nesting`
- `multi-line-array` `shape: keep`
- `multi-line-chain` `leadingLinks: sameLine`
- `multi-line-condition` `shape: [perLine, compact]`
- `multi-line-signature` `promotedProperties: ownLines`
- `object-operator-spacing`
- `offset-bracket-spacing`
- `phpdoc-alignment`
- `semicolon-spacing` `after: single`
- `strict-types-required` `placement: openingTagLine`
- `ternary-operator-spacing` `spacing: single`
- [trailing-comma |rules/trailing-comma] `multiLine: [arrays, arguments, parameters]`


`dresscode/cleanup`
===================

Kód, který je tam zbytečně: prázdné a nadbytečné konstrukce, opakování toho, co už se stalo, úlomek bez stylu, skládá se s libovolným standardem. Pravidel celkem: 18.

- `commented-out-function`
- `no-duplicate-assignment`
- `no-empty-comment`
- `no-empty-statement`
- `no-unreachable-catch`
- `useless-attribute-parentheses`
- `useless-braces`
- `useless-catch-variable`
- `useless-construct-parentheses`
- `useless-else`
- `useless-if-condition-with-return`
- `useless-modifier`
- `useless-null-property-initialization`
- `useless-parameter-default`
- `useless-parentheses-around-new`
- `useless-return`
- `useless-string-concat`
- `useless-ternary-operator`


`dresscode/modern`
==================

Syntaxe, kterou cílová verze PHP už umí, úlomek bez stylu, skládá se s libovolným standardem. Pravidel celkem: 9.

- `arrow-function`
- `combined-assignment-operator`
- `combined-issets`
- `combined-unsets`
- `modern-class-name-reference`
- `null-coalescing-operator`
- [octal-notation |rules/octal-notation]
- `short-array-syntax`
- [short-ternary-operator |rules/short-ternary-operator]


